# Data licence

The files in `packages/data/src` contain information derived from the
[Hades Wiki](https://hades.fandom.com/).

That wiki states its licence in the footer of every page:

> Community content is available under CC BY-NC-SA unless otherwise noted.

Fandom's default for a community is CC BY-SA 3.0, but individual communities may
use CC BY-NC or CC BY-NC-SA instead. See https://www.fandom.com/licensing. The
Hades Wiki is one of the NonCommercial communities.

These data files are therefore published under **CC BY-NC-SA**, with attribution
to the Hades Wiki. Two consequences follow, and both are binding on anyone who
reuses this directory:

- **NonCommercial.** You may not use these data files for commercial purposes.
- **ShareAlike.** If you adapt them, you must distribute your version under the
  same licence.

The rest of the repository uses the MIT licence. MIT does not, and cannot, apply
to this directory.

## What is stored here

Entry names, section names, and the decomposition of each requirement into
single verifiable actions.

Prose from the game itself, such as the text of Codex entries, is not stored
here. That text belongs to Supergiant Games and is not covered by the wiki's
licence.
